    "No currently selected, governed-started or in-progress product work is eligible for reduction.",
    "MAS is excluded in full.",
    "Every family reduction must perform and record an intra-family overlap audit before count mutation.",
    "Every family reduction must perform and record a cross-family/shared-owner overlap audit using PDCP_CROSS_FAMILY_OVERLAP_REGISTER.md.",
    "Generic infrastructure should have one practical owner; specialist families retain only domain-specific adapters, semantics, UX and proof.",
    "No disposition may delete accepted capability, golden-proof, migration, recovery, accessibility, permission/privacy, provenance or deterministic-validation obligations.",
    "Every non-retained baseline tranche must map its residual implementation/proof work to a named surviving tranche or existing governed owner.",
    "A baseline tranche referenced by ROADMAP_DEPENDENCY_GRAPH.json may be removed or renumbered only with an atomic graph update to an equivalent surviving gate.",
